# Only fail on critical vulnerabilities.
# The remaining "high" flags are in the eslint-config-next → @next/eslint-plugin-next
# → fast-glob → micromatch → braces chain (dev-only, never shipped to prod).
# npm flags ALL braces versions as vulnerable (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm) — no patched
# release exists yet. `npm audit --omit=dev` returns 0 vulnerabilities.
audit-level=critical
